    "UIName": "Urbiestator",
    "Id": "chassisdef_urbiestator_UMS-R2002",
    "Name": "Urbiestator",
    "Details": "The UMS-R2002 replaces the SRM launchers of the -R2000 with two more LRM-20 launchers, but as a result the designers had to downgrade the two Rocket Pack 20s to four Rocket 20 launchers. As a compensation the rockets were exchanged for the Inferno variety, threating most 'Mechs with instant heat shutdown.\n\n<b><color=#e62e00>Quirk: 360° Torso Twist</color></b>\n\n<b><color=#e62e00>Drop Cost Multiplier: 1.44</color></b>\n\n<color=#FFEF00>Arm Actuator Limits: Left Upper, Right Upper</color>",
