  "StockRole": "MegaUrbanMech",
  "YangsThoughts": "Know who the most dangerous person in the world is? An Engineer, given a blank check to do whatever they want. Kim Aakawa, a relative to the Director of the Tonegawa Major shipyard, was scouted for such a project. The result? A bulked up DevastatUrb: the Urbiestator, a 200t mad dream of Urbies come to life. The shipyard has a constant demand for the Urbiestator from all over the Periphery, with each of the few handcrafted units produced each year being handed off in pompous ceremonies to the lucky recipients.",
